"package:accessibility/speech-dispatcher[]).  Documentation is available at "
"https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtspeech-index.html and https://doc.qt.io/"
"qt-6/qttexttospeech-index.html.  To install, run:"
msgstr ""
"Las librerias package:accessibility/qt5-speech[] y package:accessibility/"
"qt6-speech[] dan acceso a funciones de texto-a-voz (especificamente a "
"package:accessibility/speech-dispatcher[]).  La documentación está "
"disponible en https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qtspeech-index.html y "
"https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qttexttospeech-index.html.  Para instalar:"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/development/_index.adoc:142
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# pkg install qt5-speech\n"
"# pkg install qt6-speech\n"
msgstr ""
"# pkg install qt5-speech\n"
"# pkg install qt6-speech\n"

